{"id":"n15013-1-5","stage":2,"title":"뒷골목 · 小胡同","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15013-1-5-1","ko":"밤에는 뒷골목 말고 큰길로 다녀.","zh":"晚上出门的时候别走小巷，走大路吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밤에는","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤에는","audio":"/audio/8eb937371c89529e0be8.mp3"}},{"text":"뒷골목","meaning":"小胡同，窄巷","explanation":"뒷골목：小胡同，窄巷","readings":[{"term":"뒷골목","audio":"/audio/5fe8036ac678d40f7af4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15013","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒷골목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒷골목","audio":"/audio/5fe8036ac678d40f7af4.mp3"}},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要选……而要选……","explanation":"뒷골목 말고 큰길로 指不要走小巷而要走大路；말고 用来排除前面的选择。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"3","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말고","audio":"/audio/1473c8e39b00e08bbd22.mp3"}},{"text":"큰길로","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔；路，道，道路","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；길：路，道，道路；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"},{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"1","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰길로","audio":"/audio/ab142369bf75ebf8cbfb.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀.","meaning":"走、通行（经常出行的路线）","explanation":"다니다：走、通行（经常出行的路线）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"5","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀","audio":"/audio/e3a1a0dcaf78067a8719.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"5fe8036ac678d40f","term":"뒷골목","zh":"小胡同，窄巷","audio":"/audio/5fe8036ac678d40f7af4.mp3","entryId":"15013","definition":"大路后面的小弄堂。","pronunciation":["뒤ː꼴목","뒫ː꼴목"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"排除前一项、选择后一项","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"排除前一项、选择后一项","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，高，长，壮阔","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"长度、宽度、高度、体积等都超出了普通程度。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路，道，道路","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"供人或车等通行的，以一定宽度延伸的长长的地面上空间。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"走、通行（经常出行的路线）","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"走、通行（经常出行的路线）","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/06fbf7b31df54b66751b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15013-1-5-2","ko":"알았어. 걱정 마.","zh":"知道了，别担心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알았어.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"알았어","audio":"/audio/dede206a3da7cc7d567c.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}},{"text":"마.","meaning":"不再做，停止","explanation":"말다：不再做，停止；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마","audio":"/audio/0a8a81fee098641dbae5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不再做，停止","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"表示使无法做之前的话所指的行动。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/60562ab93bf08be71083.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.792,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15013","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":64,"sequenceScore":1.6187,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["知道了，别担心。","晚上出门的时候别走小巷，走大路吧。","您已经要走了吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["晚上出门的时候别走小巷，走大路吧。","您已经要走了吗？","知道了，别担心。"],"answer":2}]}
